\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) kein Prolog, \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Is\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Text\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Marginalglosse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Visio Ysaye etc. Hic accendendum est ad formam tractatus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et primo premittitur breuis prefacio, secundo subditur narracio. In prefacione quatuor manifestantur: primum est ordo huius libri ... - ... in gloriam electorum et ipsius dei principaliter, qui sit benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 RB IV, Nr. 5872}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ),
