\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prolog zu Ez}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<perti sunt celi et uidi uisiones dei, Ezechielis primo.}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In uerbo proposito ab Ezechiele dicto possunt notari quatuor cause libri Ezechielis prophete, scilicet: efficiens que est duplex, principalis et instrumentalis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 RB IV, Nr. 5877}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Rest von 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer, (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Marginalglosse zum Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prologus iste habet nouem partes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in prima ostenditur quis auctor libri et qualis, et ubi scripserit. Secundo, quo tempore scripsit, ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 RB III, Nr. 3696: Hugo de S. Caro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ),
