\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prolog zu Ez}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<Zechiel propheta cum Joachim}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [interlinear eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Juda captiwus ductus est in Babilonem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 RB I, Nr. 492}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Rest von 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer,}

