\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 Fragm. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (I): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5260[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 rechts}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  beschnittenes Einzelblatt, heutige Gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dfe: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5360[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 31 x 9,5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Schriftraum: H\u246 \'f6he > 28, Breite ca. 16,5 (rekonstruiert), Einrichtung des Schriftraums und der Zeilen mit Tinte. 2 Spalten, 37 Zeilen erhalten, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Textualis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte 14. Jh.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ges\u228 \'e4nge in kleinerem Schriftgrad als Gebete. Rubriziert: rote \u220 \'dcberschriften und liturgische Rubriken, Strichelung der Anfangsbuchstaben, am Beginn der {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ges\u228 \'e4nge}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  einzeilige rote Lombarden, Rest einer vierzeiligen roten I-Initiale (wohl am Beginn des Evangeliums). Inhalt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5209/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Breviarium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , u. a. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 I}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Dominica infra octauam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [Epiphaniae]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Kurzverweise:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Cap. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >S<urge illuminare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Resp. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 >I<}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 [n]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17  columbe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [specie] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C-DB 6892}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), ..., (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) [Octava Epiphaniae (13.01.):] Ant. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 [Vox de caelis sonuit et vox]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17  patris audita est: hic est filius meus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20   ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C-DB 5507}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Feria iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lectio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 >I<lli de proximo a}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 [dducti]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 , gentiles de longe adducti }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 [sonst: reducti]}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 . Prope enim erant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [Iudaei qui] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 deum colebant, longe eran\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [t ge]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ntiles qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [idolis ser]uiebant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (\u228 \'e4hnlich: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Fulgentius Ruspensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 De epiphania deque innocentum nece et muneribus magorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , sermo IV, cap. 3), Ant. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 >V<}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 [identes stellam magi gavi]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 si sunt gaudio magno}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C-DB 5391}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) etc. bis Ant.\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 >C<eli aperti sunt super eum et vox facta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [est de caelo ...] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C-DB 1835}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

