\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Kommentar zu Eph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<AVLVS apostolus etc. (Eph 1,1,). Hanc epistolam scribit apostolus Ephesiis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ephesii autem sunt Asyani: hii per Paulum non fundati, sed confirmati fuerant in fide. ... - ... Vel gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit vobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in incorruptione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eph 6,24)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , id est in uita eterna, cum,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est et omnibus,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui diligunt dominum nostrum,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [in Auszeichnungsschrift:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iesvm Cristvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
