\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 62}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Colossenses}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Text\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Kommentar zu Col\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P>AULus apostolus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Col 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hanc epistolam scribit apostolus Colosensibus. Colosenses autem sunt Asyani, quibus non ipse apostolus predicauit, sed eius discipuli Archyppus et Epafras. ... - ... uel ut pro eo orent, ut necessaria ministrent.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Que autem sit salutatio, ostendit addens: Gratia domini Ihesu sit uobiscum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Col 4,18)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kommentar: PL 192, Sp. 258D-288D, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 RB IV, Nr. 6661}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 selten interlineare Glossen, z. B. 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Col 1,21: inimici sensu - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Ambrosius: sensus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Col 2,2: ut consulentur - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Ambrosius: ut consolationem accipiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in omnes divitias - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Augustinus: uel omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Augustinus: uel diuitiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Col 2,2: in agnitionem mysterii - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Augustinus: uel ad cognoscendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Augustinus: mysterium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Col 2,15: expolians principatus - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Augustinus: exuens se carne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

