\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Beginn der {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Marginalglosse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onimus]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verba Ecclesiastes filii David\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ecl 1,1). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tribus nominibus uocatus est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Salomon, id est: pacificus, et Idida, id est: dilectus domini ... et Coeleth, id est Ecclesiastes Grece ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [egorius]:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quomodo hic liber sit legendus et exponendus sic dicit: Ecclesiastes autem proprie contionator dicitur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , endet (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stabat Amos supra murum litum et dixit dominus ad eum: Quid vides, Amos? ... - ... loquitur ad populum iam penitentem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,
