\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 250}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  de {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 secunda}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  feria {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pentecosten}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo magistri {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannis Hoenshem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Secunda feria Penthecosten<. >P<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 acem relinquo vobis, pacem meam do vobis ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Io 14,27)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Augustinus 19 de ciuitate dei }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [lib. 19, cap. 11]:}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Tantum est pacis bonum, ut in rebus terrenis atque mortalibus nichil gracius soleat audiri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vnde}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sequitur, quod omnes homines, quantumcumque sint aliis molesti ... - ... Tercio specialiter peruenitur ad has duas ... Quarto per iusticiam tribuendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [bricht ab, Spalte 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer].
