\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [I]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 NCIPIVNT notabilia supradicti domini Ludouici Pontani anni sequentis in dicto studio Senensi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  modum qui sequitur etc. Et legebat infortiato titulum \lquote Soluto matrimonio\rquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Digesta seu Pandectae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. XXIV, tit.3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc. Tu audiuisti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Druck: audisti]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a magistro tuo .l. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : lege Codicem \lquote De pactis\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Codex Iustinianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. II, tit. 3, cap. 1).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sed quero\lquote De duobus\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [reis stipulandi et promittendi] (vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Codex Iustinianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. III, tit. 16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 habes glossam singularem et ibi Bartolus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (={\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  m. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (magister?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : lege \lquote legittima\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Codicem eodem titulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Codex Iustinianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. V, tit. 30 \lquote De legitima tutela\rquote \plain \f2\lang1033\fs28 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... et hoc addas ad dicta iura, quia faciet tibi honorem. Ludouicus Pontanus de vrbe Romana vtriusque iuris doctor famosissimus in orbeque notissimus. Deo gratias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Druck:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt singularia famosissimi utriusque iuris Monarce domini Ludouici Pontani de Roma].
