\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 258}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 -259}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 4: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  zu Decretales I,40 (De his, quae vi metusve causa fiunt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine sancte trinitatis ... Repetiturus c. fi. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De his, que vi metusve causa fiunt situatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretales Gregorii IX., lib. I, tit. 40}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consuetum seruabo ordinem repetencium. Ad honorem illius, cuius consilio ac diuina ordinacione ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3-7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In presenti eciam actu quatuor sum facturus. Primo namque diuini nominis inuocacionem ... secundo littere et notabilium textualium expedicionem ... tercio quorundam dubiorum descisionem ... quarto et ultimo dominorum baccalariorum decretorum opponere uolencium argumentacionem beniuole audiam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18-20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Ac sub dominorum meorum doctorum iuridice facultatis famosissimorum defensionis clipeo et precipue uenerabilis et egregij uiri magistri {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorij Staynbricher de Strigonia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  decretorum doctoris eximij necnon fautoris et promotoris mei specialissimj ... - ... Uenio nunc ad quartum et ultimum, in quo dominorum meorum decretorum baccalariorum opponere volencium argumentacionem audire debeam defensionj ac correxioni uenerabilium dominorum iuridice facultatis doctorum eximiorum me humiliter submittens. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rest von 259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

