\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 266}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 -267}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 8: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collatio doctoralis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In presenti actu quatuor per ordinem sunt per me peragenda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Primo etenim quandam breuem diuinj nominis inuocacionem michi summe in hoc actu necessariam premittam, secundo oraciunculam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quandam iuridice facultatis recommendaticam pro uirum mearum possibilitate submittam, tercio titulum michi per venerabiles ac egregios huius nostre facultatis iuridice doctores ... assignatis incipiam. Quo facto ... Ad quartum michi utique difficilius scilicet ad referendum laudes et graciarum actiones deo et dominis et preceptoribus meus hunc actum suis presenciis decorantibus me diuertam. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 8] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quantum ad primum: Celeberrimi uiri patres incliti ... - ... nobis faciat ad contemplandum eternaliter uerum solem iusticie dominum nostrum ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Abschnitt 3 und 4 gek\u252 \'fcrzt:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tercio videlicet tituli lectione causa breuitatis in aliud tempus reseruato. Ad quartum michi difficilius ad laudes uidelicet et graciarum actiones referendos me diuerto etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Rest von 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

