\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Rectoseite, Z. 6}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Item dicit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cyprianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [...], (Z. 7) [su]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 is plagis et fragellis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (!), (Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 vii dona spiritus sancti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...], (Z. 15-18) [aurium et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 narium de sputo lin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [itio ...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  in pectore facta crucis consign\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [atio ...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  in scapulis olei ad cath\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [echuminis ...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  in aquis baptismi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...], (Z. 20-25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 crismatis ab episcopo confir\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 donum sapientie. Secundum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...spirit]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ualis intelligentie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 sit ut uirtus passionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 corpus et animam sicut \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...], (Z. 27) [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 autem ut ungitur in pectore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [...],
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Versoseite, Z. 8f.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 De cathechumis autem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 precederit baptismum dicendum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...], (Z. 16) [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 dicimus quod ex exercismo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...], (Z. 20-24) [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ad spiritualem medicinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 consequitur per exorcismum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 quorum unus moriatur sine baptismo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Alter vero moriatur exorcizatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [...]. 
