\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Athanasius Alexandrinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita beati Antonii abbatis, interprete Evagrio presbytero Antiocheno}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus I:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit epistola Euagrij presbiteri de uita sancti {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antonii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <. >P<resbiter Euagrius Innocentio karissimo filio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [in domino]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ex alia in aliam linguam ad uerbum expressum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: expressa]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  translatio, sensus operit, ... - ... Alii sillabas aucupentur et litteras, tu quere sententias \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: sententiam]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus II:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit epistola secunda ad peregrinos monachos.< >O<ptimum, fratres, inistis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: iniistis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  certamen contra monachos, qui sunt in Egypto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [sonst:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 aut aequari Aegypti monachis, aut superare nitentes virtutis instantia.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... non putet digna \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: dignum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  esse miraculo pro tanti nominis uiro. >Explicit epistola<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit uita sancti Antonij monachi<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >I<Gitur Antonius nobilibus religiosisque parentibus natus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [interlinear erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egypto oriundus fuit, tanta suorum et sua nutritus cura, ut nichil aliud preter parentes domumque cognosceret. ... - ... deceptores scilicet hominum, et tocius deceptionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: corruptionis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 artifices.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Epilogus, nicht eigens abgesetzt:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Itaque prudentes, qui legere uoluerint hanc scripturam, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [obsecramus, ut]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dent ueniam, ... - ... et saluatorem nostrum Ihesum Christum cum spiritu sancto, cui est claritas et perpetua potestas in secula seculorum. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 PL 73}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sp. 125-168D, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 BHL 609}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 W}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 N}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

