\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 185}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Liber II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Miracula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Praefatio:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit prefaciuncula in libellum secumdum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de uirtutibus sancti {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Columbani}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Q<voniam gesta et miracula, que dominus noster per merita}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 patroni nostri}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  sanctissimi Columbani pandere dignatus est ab ortu natiuitatis eius ad aduentum ipsius in partibus Ebobiensis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... quicquid esset requirendum in corpore. >Explicit prefatio<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Incipit liber secundus de aduentu sancti Columbani in Ytaliam et constructione ecclesie Ebobiensi<. >S<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 anctus igitur Columbanus Ybernia ortus, post alia cenobia in partibus Galliarum structa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... Quod et factum est et usque hodie peragunt ad laudem domini nostri Ihesu Christi, qui uiuit et regnat ... >Explicit uita sancti Columbani abbatis<.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck (liber II): Luc d' \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Achery\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mabillon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Acta Sanctorum Ordinis S. Benedicti in S\u230 \'e6culorum Classes distributa. S\u230 \'e6culum secundum ..., Venedig 1733, S. 37-51. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 BHL 1901}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Vita) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 1905}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Miracula); Catalogus codicum hagiographicorum latinorum bibliothecae Ambrosianae Mediolanensis, in: Analecta Bollandiana 11 (1892), S. 205-368, hier S. 326-328 (nach der Hs. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Bibl. Ambr., G. 33. Sup.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 15. Jh., aus dem Kloster des Hl. Columbanus in Bobbio, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). }

