\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >IN PURIFICACIONE SANCTAE MARIAE. OMELIA BEATI AUGUSTINI EPISCOPI. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<xultent}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: exsultent] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uirgines; uirgo peperit Christum; nihil in ea, quod uouit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: uouerunt]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  putent exterminatum: mansit uirgo post partum. ... - ... ad illum pertinuit propter nos nasci, ad nos pertinet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: pertineat]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in illo renasci: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Schluss gegen\u252 \'fcber Druck abweichend] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui uenit in hunc mundum peccatores saluos facere Ihesus Christus dominus noster cui est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [gloria et potestas in secula seculorum. Amen].
