\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bernhardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Libellus de regimine vitae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit libellus sancti Bernhardi de regimine vite<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<i vis esse perfectus (Mt 19,21) hoc regulariter et firmiter teneas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Primo semper habeas pre oculis tuis mala tua et bona aliorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... Ista diligenter corde seruato etc.
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 Nicht ediert. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (ohne diese Hs.) vgl. \plain \f3\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bloomfield\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 , Incipits, Nr. 5677 und Suppl. Auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, HAB, Cod. Guelf. 369}}\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22  Helmst. (Northeim, Benediktinerkloster, 1421-26), 245\plain \f3\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 -246\plain \f3\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. Beschreibung von Bertram Lesser: http://diglib.hab.de/?db=mss&list=ms&id=369-helmst&catalog=Lesser.}

