\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verse, Schemata und Exzerpte zum Thema Tods\u252 \'fcnden, Beichte, Bu\u223 \'dfe etc., lat.}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Verse mit Schemata:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Similitudines septem peccatorum mortalium. Est tumide rane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 similata superbia sane \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: plane]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Superbia. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Superbia dicit: Glorior et sperno calcansque ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, Nr. 7252}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Qualiter debeat esse confessio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sit simplex, humilis confessio, pura, fidelis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, Nr. 18330}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), mit Interlinearglossen, 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Notizen und Verse zur Beichte:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item nota circa supradictas circumstancias valde seruandum est, quod homo in confessione recitando ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit eingef\u252 \'fcgtem Merkvers: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota: Ac quid, vbi, quare, quantum, quis, quomodo, quando / Adiuncto quociens hec octo connumerando}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\u228 \'e4hnlich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Initia, Nr. 16000-16003}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~: Quis, quid, ubi ...) sowie \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Declaraccio versuum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et uult pro exposicione: Ac id est ecclesia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... est grauius peccatum quam simplex furtum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc., est finis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Exzerpte und Schemata zu moraltheologischen Begriffen: contritio, satisfactio, peccatum, veniale peccatum etc.]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Contricio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Contricio est compunccio anime cum lacrimis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Satisfaccio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Satisfaccio secundum beatum Augustinum est causas peccatorum excidere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Sed secundum beatum Anshelmum in libro \lquote Cur deus homo\rquote  sic describitur: Satisfaccio est honorem deo debitum reddere ... 
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (18\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -20\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) [Abhandlung \u252 \'fcber die Tods\u252 \'fcnden und ihre remedia:]\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Peccata venialia remittuntur multis modis ... >Superbia<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Superbia secundum beatum Augustinum: Est peruerse celsitudinis appetitus}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (s. u. 36\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundum sanctum Thomam: Superbia est cum quis extollit se ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (19\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Remedia superbie<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Remedia contra superbiam: primum est absconsio ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 , am Ende (20\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) weitere Texte \u252 \'fcber Tugenden etc., u. a. Verse: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Si tibi defuerint medici, medicamina serues\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  ..., mehrere Septenare: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Septem<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex septem rebus componitur homo ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  etc., \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Consideracio mortis<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui enim considerat, qualis erit in morte, semper fit timidus in operatione ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Iob}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 , lib. 13, pars 29).}

