\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Memoratio passionis domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Crux in templi medio<: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In templo stat crux in altum posita omnibus videnda et intuenda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , passionem domini nostri Ihesu Christi representans ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quindecim vtilitates<: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota quindecim vtilitates, ut dicit beatus Bernhardus, proueniunt hominem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex memoria passionis Christi ... - ... in hac vita ac maius in celo sibi meritum tumulabit.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ein Text mit diesem Beginn auch in Ansbach, Staatl. Bibl. (Schlo\u223 \'dfbibl.), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ms. lat. 22}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Riedfeld OFM, 1455), 215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Keller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ansbach I, S. 72.}

