\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Formulare zur Absolution Sterbender, mit \u8222 \'84Quaestiones Anselmi\ldblquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Exhortacio morituri<:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur exhortacio morituri. Anshelmus dat consilia circa hominem moriturum, ut securus possit exire de mundo ... Frater morti appropinquans debet sic interrogari illeque respondere: Filii seu frater aut soror leteris in habitu clericali uel cuiuscumque professionis fuerit. Respondeat: Ita. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 auch in Mainz, StadtB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hs I 33}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (15. Jh., 1. Viertel), 229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 List/Powitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Mainz StB I, S. 77,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Forma absolucionis<: Presbiter siue confessor audita confessione alicuius antequam absoluat confitentem ... unde dicat: Passio domini nostri Ihesu Christi et merita omnium sanctorum suorum et anima bona, que fecisti et facere proponis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , es folgen vier weitere Absolutionsformeln.}

