\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1. Schema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<ecundum Bonauenturam hore canonice sunt dicende}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [mit Schweifklammern]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Intellectualiter - cum intencione mentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 affectualiter - cum affectione cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ...
