\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 1. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 H\u228 \'e4ufigkeit der Zelebration\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De non celebracione<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Venerabilis Beda dicit: Sacerdos, qui sine peccatis mortalibus est et in bono proposito est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non peccande, si non celebrat cum possit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De cottidian\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [o]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus: ... Cottidie eukaristie communionem accipere nec laudo nec uitupero ... Glossa hac dixit: Augustinus ignorans mentes sumentium, vtrum sunt digni ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , weitere Zitate von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Archidiaconus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guido de Baysio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ambrosius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 vgl. Decretum Gratiani, pars 3, dist. 2, canon 13 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  I, Sp. 1318), mit Glossa ordinaria des Johannes Teutonicus in der Bearbeitung von Bartholomaeus Brixiensis, vgl. Druck Mainz 1472, GW 11353, Digitalisat: http://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/bsb00036987/image_776;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 2. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Sieben Fr\u252 \'fcchte der Messe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Virtutes misse<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius dicit: Dum missa cantatur uel legitur peccata tam viuorum quam mortuorum condonantur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Celebracio tantum valet quantum mors Christi in cruce ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima virtus est, quod quantum spacium terre aliquis infra missam pertransire poterat ... - ... et angeli presentes et ipse filius dei in manu sacerdotis.}

