\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De mundacio altarium<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item notandum dubitatur de duobus: Primo quia tempore passionis Christi altaria mundantur et nudantur, secundo quare tredecim lumina successiue exti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gwuntur. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quare capmpane non pulsantur<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Diceres, quare in hiis diebus campane non pulsantur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Psalmi ante missam<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota sacerdos celebraturus missarum sollempnia dicit hos psalmos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De ewangelio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quare ewangelium legitur in sinstra parte altaris ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Interpretationes litterarum hebraicarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur de illis diccionibus Alleph, Beth etc. qualiter tempore passionis Christi cantantur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Lamentationes Jeremiae], mit Erkl\u228 \'e4rung zu den einzelnen Buchstaben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nam Alleph quod est prima in ordine interpretatur doctrina et sapiencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item Beth interpretatur confusio ... Item tercia diccio Gymel interpretatur retribucio ... - ... Et hec dicctiones sunt sumpte de libro Trenorum id est de libro lamentato \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Jeremie prophete. }

