\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De sacramento corporis et sangwinis domini<: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Manna habuit omnem saporem suauitatis et fuit figura corporis Ihesu Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Circa hoc sacramentum ista tria consideranda sunt, scilicet, quod aliud est ibi sacramentum et non res, aliud est sacramentum et res, aliud res et non sacramentum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in den Text eingef\u252 \'fcgt k\u252 \'fcrzere Exzerpte, u. a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernhardus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Damascenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , endet (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >De indulgencia<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Indulgencia ad quinque valet: ad ignorancie expunctionem ... Hoc Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

