\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De baptismo<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Baptismus est ablucio sordium corporis et anime ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De confirmacione<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacerdos moneat populum ad confirmacionem puerorum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De confessione<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De Eukaristia<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De vnccione<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De matrimonio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Precipimus strictissime, ut matrimonium in reuerencia celebretur. Sciendum est autem, quod plurima sint impedimenta in contraccione matrimonii ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , weitere Exzerpte zu Einzelfragen, die Eheschlie\u223 \'dfung betreffend: (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Dispar cultus error<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dispar cultus impedit matrimonium, scilicet cum ambo non eiusdem religionis sunt, ut si Christianus ducat Saracenam seu Judeam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc.}

