\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De octo speciebus turpitudinis, prima<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Octo sunt species turpitudinis, quas quicumque coniugati inter se solent facere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Prima est coytus diebus et noctibus sacris ... >Secunda species<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secunda species est accessus virorum ad mulieres menstruosas - ... sed absque dubio eternaliter dampnabitur. >Et sic est finis huius<.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 3589. Dieser Text auch in Graz, UB, Ms. 243 (2. H\u228 \'e4lfte 14. Jh), 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. http://sosa2.uni-graz.at/sosa/katalog/katalogisate/243.html; Wien, Dominikanerkonvent, Cod. 140/110, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. http://manuscripta.at/m1/hs_detail.php?ID=6009. Zum Text vgl. Ewelina Kaczor, \plain \f3\lang1024\fs20 "Peccata matrimoniales": wykroczenia przeciw moralno\u347 \'9cci ma\u322 \'b3\u380 \'bfe\u324 \'f1skiej w \u347 \'9cwietle "Noty penitencjalnej" z XV-wiecznego r\u281 \'eakopisu ze zbior\u243 \'f3w Biblioteki Wy\u380 \'bfszego Seminarium Duchownego Kielcach = Peccata matrimoniales : offenses against marriage morality in the face of a penitentiary note from the 15th-century manuscript in the library of seminary in Kielce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Rocznik Muzeum Narodowego w Kielcach, Tom 30, Kielce 2015, S. 104-111 [Onlineausgabe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 https://mnki.pl/download.php?id=9&t=r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ].}

