\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Vorsatz vorn ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) [Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von H 2]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Exzerpte}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  aus klassischen Autoren (Seneca und Ps.-Seneca, Aulus Gellius, Cassiodorus), Kirchenv\u228 \'e4tern (Gregorius Magnus, Augustinus) sowie mittelalterlichen Autoren (Martinus Bracarensis) zum Thema 'De servis'\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De servis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Martinus Braccarensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De moribus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 , cap. 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 Seneca liber de moribus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Qui in seruos suos irascitur et crudelis est, satis ostendit potestatem aduersus alienos sibi defuisse.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Vgl. PL 72, Sp. 32A;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 Idem ibidem\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Plerique \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 hominum stulti sunt, qui \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 serviles cibos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  et servilem vestem fugiunt, serviles mores non fugiunt. Vgl. Ps.-Caecilius Balbus: De nugis philosophorum, hier {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Euclides}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  zugeschrieben, vgl. Eduard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Woefflin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Hg.), Caecilio Balbi De nugis philosophorum, Basel 1855, S. 38;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 3.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Aulus Gellius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Noctes Atticae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 lib. 2, c. 18, pars 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 A. Gellius liber 2\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Cum Diogenes ex libertate in seruitutem venderetur, quem cum emere quidam vellet ... respondit: noui, inquit, hominibus liberis imperare. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Vgl. Ed. Leipzig 1903 (hg. von E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Hosius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), S. 114;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 4.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Moralia in Iob}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 , lib. 4, pars 23,42\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 Gregorius in moralia\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Quis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [quis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  accingi in diuino officio se preperat, quid aliud facit quam se contra antiqui antiqui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 aduersarii certamen parat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. CCSL 143, S. 189, Z. 26-32, sowie (\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 Nr. 5 und 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) zwei weitere Exzerpte nach Gregorius Magnus (Homilia super Ezechielem und Moralia in Iob);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 7.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cassiodorus}}\plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Variarum libri duodecim}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 , lib. 12, epist. 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cassiodoris libro primo epistolarum, epistola 1: contra karge knechte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 dominorum largorum. Mutant enim quaslibet largitates malorum seruiencium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Ed.: rapientium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 manus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. Ed.: CCSL 96, S. 475;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 8.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Seneca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De beneficiis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 , lib. 3, cap. 21\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Seneca liber 3 de beneficiis. Quam diu seruus prestatur, quod a seruo exigi solet, ministerium est; ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Vgl. Ed. Leipzig 1914 (hg. von E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Hosius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), S. 66;
