\pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fragment 1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : als {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5234/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ansetzfalz}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  zwischen vorderem Spiegel und Beginn des Textblocks kopfst\u228 \'e4ndig 3,5 cm breiter Pergamentstreifen (foliiert als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Schriftraumh\u246 \'f6he: \u252 \'fcber 27,5 cm, Schriftraumbreite nicht zu rekonstruieren. 44 Zeilen erhalten, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 fr\u252 \'fchgot. Minuskel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 letztes Viertel 12. / fr\u252 \'fches 13. Jh.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , kleinerer Schriftgrad bei den Ges\u228 \'e4ngen als bei den Lesungen und Gebeten, interlineare Neumen. Inhalt: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Breviarium, Purificatio BMV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 In primo Nocturno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , u. a. Ant. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speciosa facta es}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [et suavis] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 4988}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Ant. [Sicut myrrha] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 electa odorem dedisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [suavitatis sancta dei genetrix] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 4942}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Lectio, Resp. [Adorna thal]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 amum tuum Sion}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [et suscipe regem Christ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 um, quem uirgo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [concepit ...] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 6051}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Vers. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Accipi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ens Simeon puerum ...] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 6051a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc.; (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 In secundo Noc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [turno]<, Ant. [Ante torum huius v]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 irginis frequentate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nobis ...] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 1438}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Ant. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Super salutem et omne]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 m pulcritudinem di}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [lecta es a domino sancta d]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ei genetrix}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 5063}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc., Lectiones: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus Hipponensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Sermones ad populum, sermo 370 (De Nativitate domini), u. a. (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<xsultent uirgi}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [nes; uirgo peperit]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Christum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nichil in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ea quod uouerunt putent] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 exterminatum: m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ansit uirgo post partum. ...] (PL 39, Sp. 1657).}

