\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 -3}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bernardus Claravallensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola de cura rei familiaris}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Raimundum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistola beati Bernardi de modo regendi se et familiam. Graciosi et felici militi reuerendo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ed.: Raymundo]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domino castri Ambrosii, Bernardus in senium deductus salutem. Doceri petisti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ed.: petis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a nobis de cura et modo rei familiaris utilius gubernande, et qualiter patresfamilias debeant se habere, ... Audi ergo et attende quod si in tua domo sumptus et redditus sunt equales, casus inopinatus poterit destruere statum eius. ... - ... quibus abiectis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ed.: habitis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bibet cum eo doloris calicem quem optauit, ad quem eam perducat sua dampnabilis senectus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ed.: eam perducant merita suae dampnabilis senectutis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Druck: PL 182, Sp. 647A-651A; Edition: Clive D. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Cossar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The German translations of the Pseudo-Bernhardine \u8218 \'82Epistola de cura rei familiaris\lquote  (G\u246 \'f6ppinger Arbeiten zur Germanistik 166), G\u246 \'f6ppingen 1975 S. 97-102, zur lat. \u220 \'dcberlieferung (Auswahl, ohne diese Hs.) S. 1f. Zur Verfasserfrage (Bernardus Silvestris?) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pour rev. Migne, S. 70; Werner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 VL 1 (1978), Sp. 758; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sch\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 nberger/Kible\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hg), Repertorium edierter Texte, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2011, S. 900-904.}

