\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit epistola beati Gregorii pape ad Leandrum episcopum Hyspalensem in librum Iob.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >R<Euerendissimo et sanctissimo fratri Leandro}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  coepiscopo Gregorius seruus seruorum dei. Dudum te, frater beatissime, in Constantinopolitana urbe cognoscens, cum me illic sedis apostolice responsa constringerent ... - ... quia sedes apostolica cui deo auctore presideo utraque utitur, mei quoque labor studii ex utraque fulciatur etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ed.: CCSL 143, S. 1-7.}

