\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (li. Spalte) \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Captiuitas\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 gefangenheyt\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Inde cap\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tiu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 us: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn gefangener \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo C 160.3; Brev. Druck S. 101],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 cium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : vestis que tantum tegit caput ... Inde capucipendium: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn kogelczippil\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... propie: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn korder\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo C 159; Brev: Hs., 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Caput\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : n. 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... est principale membrum ipsius hominis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo C 158: nur Lemma; Brev. Druck S. 101], (re. Spalte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Caprificus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est quidam erba \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Capus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eciam est auis: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn falgk\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo C 143.1; Brev. Druck S. 101],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Capulus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est ferrum uel manubrium gladii ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo C 160.1; Brev. Druck S. 101],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Capsicus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [-um\~: span. Pfeffer] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est herba sparsim crescens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo --; Brev. --],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Capo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -eris est gallus gastratus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versus: Non caponem caupo comedit, ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo C 144: Cappo; Brev. Druck S. 100: Capo; Vers: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 17358],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Capisterium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est vas quoddam ...: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyne molte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo C 135; Brev. Druck S. 100],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Capa\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -e est vestis circumdans caput et corpus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo C 142; Brev. Druck S. 99],
