\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (linke Spalte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 siue mortale, inferens mortem. \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exiguus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... paruus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 403; Brev. Druck S. 190], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exilis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... sterilis, paruus uel modicus ... proprie \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 cleyntuchtig ader geringe \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 405], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exilium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  n. ... peregrinacio, dampnacio uel miseria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 407; Brev. Druck S. 190], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Eximius\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -a -um, dicitur nobilis, preclarus, nagnus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 408.1; Brev. Druck S. 190], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exitus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est egressio uel eciam est morbus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --; Brev. Druck S. 190],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exermis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... est aliquis extra armis ...: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn vngewopitter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo I 349: Inermis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Expedicio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  f. ... est preparacio uel promptitudo ad bellum: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 herfart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo E 435], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Expense\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... proprie \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 koste ader czerunge \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 439], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Expiacio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... proprie \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 reuunge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Explorator\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... inquisitor uel curiosus cognitor: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn ausporer \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 457], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exprobracio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... redargutio: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 vorweysunge \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 464], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [s]\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 pes\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : sine spe \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 432.1],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exseruatus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : secundum voluntatem iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [...].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zum \u8218 \'82Voc. Brev.\lquote , vgl. Druck 1478, Bild 190.
