\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Fragment Nr. 15:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 (= II 2\u176 \'b0 21, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 vorderer Spiegel, rechte Doppelblatth\u228 \'e4lfte}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Buchstabenbereich}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Fab-Fal}}\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (li. Spalte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inde hic \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 fabarius\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , id est cant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [or]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et dicebantur apud gentiles cant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ores]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fabarii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Fabula\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est sermo fictus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo F 6; Brev. Druck S. 192],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Fabulator\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -oris, fabulo -onis et fabulolinus idem sunt, scilicet fabularum inuentor uel narrator ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo, F 8: Fabulones; Brev. Druck S. 192],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Facula\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -le et fax facis idem sunt, scilicet lignum ardens de nocte artificiose ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn fackel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo, F 9; Brev. Druck S. 193], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Factio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , -onis est actio uel passio faciendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... [Ex quo --; Brev. Druck S. 193]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Fagus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est quedam arbor: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn buche \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dicitur fructus eius, proprie: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn buchecker \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo F 27-28; Brev. Druck S. 193] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Et a fagus venit faginius ... et est lignum fagi, proprie: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 buchinholcz\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... locus ubi habundant fagi: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn buchinwalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  Fagina\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...producta est coopertorium cultelli uel gladii: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn scheyde \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --],\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  Falcarium \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est telum rotundum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Falanga \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... hasta eciam dicitur baculus ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn swippel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo F 31; Brev. --].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zum \u8218 \'82Voc. Brev.\lquote , vgl. Druck 1478, Bild 192.}

