\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ermofrodicus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel -ca dicitur ille, qui partim est uir et partim mulier ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo E 234; Brev: Hs., 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Erodius \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est auis quedam: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn falg\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --; Brev: Hs., 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Eripica \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 -ce est instrumentum rusticorum ad planandum terram: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn eyde\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 237 und Brev. Druck S. 183: Erpica], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Et eripica \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quasi arpica ab arpo ...: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn ege pherch\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --; Brev: Hs., 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Eruditor\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est doctor \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 250; Brev: Hs., 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Erugo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 -inis dicitur sagwisuga ...: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn egel\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... erugare ... proprie: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 swert fegen\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a quo tunc eruginator ... id est artifex ille, qui gladios eruginat: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn swerthfeger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo E 252-254; Brev. Druck S. 183],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Erumpnia\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicitur miseria, inopia, clamitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (re. Spalte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 paupertas ... proprie \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 kommerhafftig\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 256; Brev. Druck S. 184], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eris est nomen generale ad quodlibet metallum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 258; Brev. --], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Esox\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -ocis ... est quidam piscis: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn lax\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 264; Brev. Druck S. 184], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Essencia\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est naturalis ... uel eternitas: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn wesen\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 266; Brev. Druck S. 184], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Esseda\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est quoddam genus uehiculi in quo molliter sedetur. Et dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a sedes \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn flethe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eciam potest dici currus in quo molliter homines sedent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 263.6: Essedum; Brev., S. 184], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Espides \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 -a -um est asper uel ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --; Brev: Hs., 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 Zum \u8218 \'82Voc. Brev.\lquote , vgl. Hs.: Cod. Guelf. 370 Helmst., 88\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 -89\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Druck 1478, Bild 183-184.}

