\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (li. Spalte) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ethymologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diccionis exposicio in eadem lingwa, sed interpretatio fit in diuersis ydeomatibus, scilicet exponendo Latinum per Greco et econuerso et Bauaricum per Bohemicum et econuerso. Item \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ethymoloya\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 docens de significationibus uel consanguinitatibus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 28: Lemma; Brev. Druck S. 186], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ethymologus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est veriloquus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ethicus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 -a, -um, id est moralis uel aliquis tractatur de moribus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 284; Brev. Druck S. 186] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inde \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ethica\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est moralitas uel sciencia que tractat de moribus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Brev. Druck S. 186], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ethyopia\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est regio quedam \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 morland\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 287] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et est triplex ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inde \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ethyops\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn mor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo E 288; Brev. Druck S. 186], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Etnicus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  media correpta dicitur gentilis uel paganus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ex quo E 286.1] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Etrogenium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est res cuius partes non sunt eiusdem nature cum toto ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 289; Brev. --], [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est uxor Ade et interpretatur vita uel calamitas ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo, E 290; Brev. Druck S. 186], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Euan\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  grecum indeclinabile peruersum uel malum latine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 294]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inde \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 evangelium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... et est male uel peruersa nunciacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 295; Brev. Hs., 90v], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ewangelium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est bona nunciacio ab eu: bonum et gelon: nunciacio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 325; Brev. Druck S. 186] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Inde \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ewangelista \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item ewangelium debet pronuntiari ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [Brev. Druck S. 186] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vbi ... quod quatuor ewangeliste \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 quatuor figuris\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  describuntur. Vnus enim sanctus Matheus in forma hominis describitur ... Alter scilicet Iohannes habet disposicionem auis ... in celum sicut auis uolat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Fortsetzung s. u.]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zum \u8218 \'82Voc. Brev.\lquote , vgl. Hs.: Cod. Guelf. 370 Helmst., 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Druck 1478.}

