\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (li. Spalte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exalacio \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 338: Lemma; Brev. --],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exaltacio \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est sublimitas uel superbia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo --, Brev. --],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Examen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n. tercie\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... dicitur ligwa illa ... Eciam examen dicitur probacio ... Item dicitur apum congregacio proprie: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 behen swarm\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et per translacionem dicitur congregacio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 341; Brev. Druck S. 188], \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Examentrum\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uel metum sex pedum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 342; Brev. Hs., 91v],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Examerum\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est opus sex dierum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 348.2; Brev. Hs., 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exasperacio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est exacerbacio: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 bitterkeyt ader grimmckeyt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exapulum\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicitur venabulum ... proprie: \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 eyn eber spi\u223 \'df\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Excitus uel Excitatus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Exciculatores\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Excepcio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Excors\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... sine corde, fatuus, insipiens uel ignarus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ex quo E 367; Brev. Druck S. 189].
