\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 b. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 170v-172r}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Schreiben}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24  b\u246 \'f6hmischer Adliger an K\u246 \'f6nig Sigismund von Luxemburg, um die Freilassung des eingekerkerten Magisters Johannes Hus bittend, Gro\u223 \'df Meseritsch (Velk\u233 \'e9 Mezi\u345 \'f8\u237 \'ed\u269 \'e8\u237 \'ed), 20. Januar 1415. \u220 \'dcberschrift (rot unterstrichen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Literam subscriptam domini barones infrascripti pro liberacione M. Ioh. Hus regi Constanciam direxerunt ante Carnisprivium anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que sequitur et est talis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 S<lu\u382 \'9eba na\u353 \'9ae nap\u345 \'f8ed Tv\u233 \'e9 Milosti, najosviecen\u283 \'ecj\u353 \'9a\u237 \'ed knie\u382 \'9ee, kr\u225 \'e1li a pane, pane n\u225 \'e1\u353 \'9a milostiv\u253 \'fd}}\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 . Jako\u382 \'9e velebn\u253 \'fd mu\u382 \'9e a rozmno\u382 \'9eitel p\u237 \'edsma svat\u233 \'e9ho, mistr Jan Hus, jel jest ...\~\endash \~... kdy\u382 \'9e Tv\u225 \'e1 Milost pravdy mimo \u345 \'f8\u225 \'e1d ned\u225 \'e1 utiskn\u250 \'fati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Palack\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u253 \'fd\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 , in: Archiv \u269 \'e8esk\u253 \'fd 3 (wie 139r), S. 182-183; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Palack\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u253 \'fd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Documenta (wie 145v), S. 534-535; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Novotn\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u253 \'fd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hus v Kostnici (wie 169v), S. 44-45. Dt. \u220 \'dcbersetzung: Johannes Stumpf 1541 (wie 169v), Bl. XXXI.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

